libwebrtc-arm64.tar.gz contains WebRTC and the third-party libraries compiled
into libwebrtc.a, each under its own license. FFmpeg is built as a separate
shared library and is not included.

Each entry names the WebRTC source directory the code comes from. License
texts that the entries refer to are reproduced at the end of this file.

